	(text "H=12 W=12 Cin=8 Cout=16 K=3  ->  Hout=10 Wout=10\nLoop order: oc(0..15) -> oy(0..9) -> ox(0..9) -> ic(0..7) -> ky(0..2) -> kx(0..2).\nMAC/point = 8x3x3 = 72; points = 16x10x10 = 1600; total MAC = 115200.\nInput layout CHW C=8 (POOL1_OUT):  IN_ADDR = ic*144 + (oy+ky)*12 + (ox+kx)   range 0..1151\nWeight layout [oc][ic][ky][kx]:  W_ADDR = oc*72 + ic*9 + ky*3 + kx        range 0..1151\nOutput layout CHW C=16:  OUT_ADDR = oc*100 + oy*10 + ox                 range 0..1599\nOutput order: for oc, for oy, for ox -> one uint8 per output point (little-endian byte 0 only)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5822c03f-58e8-449e-8ee4-643e8e2feb77")
	)

	(text "MAC datapath identical to S07: 4x LUT_Mult_Unit, 4-deep pixel/weight pipeline, 4-product 18-bit adder tree, 32-bit accumulator (8x74HC283 + 4x74HCT574), requant core on S15."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 748 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "305169e1-7b9b-4271-89b3-1d30144cd6d2")
	)

	(text "Local FSM: 2x27C512 + 74HCT273 + 2x74HCT574 + 74HC138."
